# The build context is src/, so everything here is sent to the Docker daemon on
# every build. Without this file that means ~22 MB, of which 21 are the Java war
# and its unpacked classes — none of which any image needs.

# Java build output
backoffice/target/

# Erlang build output: the image compiles from source in its own stage, and
# .beam files built on the host would shadow it
erlang/_build/
**/.rebar3/
**/*.beam

# Node
emulator/node_modules/

# Documents: they belong in the repository, not in an image
*.md
docs/
contracts/*.md
# schema.sql is the exception — the compose file mounts it into MySQL
!contracts/schema.sql

# Editors and OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
